    "title": "<p>Two- and three-tiered systems for grading dysplasia</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Nina Zidar",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"765\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Clinical relevance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Extension of epithelial abnormalities</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Three-tiered grading system</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Two-tiered grading system</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Low-risk lesion</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Lower half</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Low-grade dysplasia/SIL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Low-grade dysplasia/SIL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">High-risk lesion</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">More than lower half</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">High-grade dysplasia/SIL</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">High-grade dysplasia/SIL</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Full thickness</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 143.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"191\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Carcinoma in&nbsp;situ</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">SIL, squamous intraepithelial lesion.</p>",
